WEBVTT

00:08:29.417 --> 00:08:32.601
I was victim-blamed and slut-shamed

00:08:32.625 --> 00:08:35.500
and told I was deserving
of what happened to me.

00:08:36.625 --> 00:08:38.518
And quite frankly,

00:08:38.542 --> 00:08:41.393
that was more difficult for me to endure

00:08:41.417 --> 00:08:45.458
than my actual experiences
of image-based abuse.

00:08:47.208 --> 00:08:50.101
But I couldn’t let
this criticism defeat me.

00:08:50.125 --> 00:08:53.184
I knew what the perpetrators
had done was wrong,

00:08:53.208 --> 00:08:56.351
and I knew what they were doing
to others was wrong.

00:08:56.375 --> 00:08:57.958
And so I petitioned.

00:08:58.917 --> 00:09:03.059
I sent out impassioned pleas for support.